# 1. PROJECT OVERVIEW

Project name: CodeComplex AI

Tagline: Understand Your Code. Predict Its Complexity.

Project category: AI-powered algorithm analysis and educational developer tool.

## Problem statement

Students and developers frequently struggle to determine the time and auxiliary space complexity of algorithms. Manual analysis requires an understanding of loops, recursion, data structures, input sizes, and algorithmic behavior.

CodeComplex AI aims to make this process easier by analyzing submitted source code, predicting its asymptotic complexity, explaining the reasoning in plain language, identifying relevant code patterns, and offering appropriate optimization suggestions.

## Main objective

Create a working website where users can:

1. Enter or paste source code.
2. Select the programming language.
3. Submit the code for analysis.
4. Receive a predicted time complexity.
5. Receive a predicted auxiliary space complexity.
6. Understand the reasoning behind both predictions.
7. See relevant loops, recursion, and data structures identified by the analyzer.
8. Review possible optimizations.
9. Understand assumptions, limitations, and uncertainty.
10. Analyze another program without refreshing the page.

The application is an educational analysis tool, not a formal proof system.

Never claim that AI predictions are guaranteed to be correct.

